step 14 "@return"
out d "\n\rWelcome to Charm.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rOn the Concourse\n\r  The concourse continues its path around the city.  The southern gates of the\n\rcity are west of here, and park road lies north.  The northeastern corner of\n\rthe city wall is east.\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can both read and write on this board.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
